    {
        "text": "A shot rings out."
    },
    {
        "text": "However, the target was not Andoain."
    },
    {
        "text": "Before he realizes it, his gun had left his hand."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 0,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "image"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "But he feels at ease."
    },
    {
        "text": "For his gun will forever remain in Laterano."
    },
    {
        "text": "He may never say it, but how can anyone help but love Laterano?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those peaceful days, those joyful times, those happy moments."
    },
    {
        "text": "But because of this 'love', he has had regrets, guilt, shame, and doubts."
    },
    {
        "text": "He may never become a true Lateran."
    },
    {
        "text": "But in this moment, when he thinks about his gun staying here forever..."
    },
    {
        "text": "At this very moment, under the glare of the faces looking at him..."
    },
    {
        "text": "A kind of peace floats to the surface like a bubble, then pops."
    },
    {
        "text": "He walked ten thousand miles on the path of faith and doubt."
    },
    {
        "text": "From one path to the next."
    },
    {
        "text": "He thought he was wandering the wilderness, far from his roots."
    },
    {
        "text": "But perhaps this was not true."
    },
    {
        "text": "In more ways than one."
    },
    {
        "text": "He whispered a word of gratitude."
    },
    {
        "text": "No one will ever hear it, not in the past, present, or future."
    },
    {
        "text": "But it was enough."
    },
