    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hotel Manager",
        "text": "Please, miss, I must ask you to come down from the signboard."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_367_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hotel Manager",
        "text": "I'll have to call the Guards if you don't comply."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_367_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hotel Manager",
        "text": "But while we're at it, I just have to know."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_367_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hotel Manager",
        "text": "How on Terra did you get up there with a wheelchair?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_353_1#10$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "Where there's a will, there's a way."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_367_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hotel Manager",
        "text": "That dust cloud... another explosion? There's been too many of those lately. It's starting to seem more like a fireworks show than a conference."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_353_1#9$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "Um, excuse me? Could you give me a hand?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_353_1#10$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "Sometimes it's easier to get up than to get down."
    },
