    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "Greetings, honored guests. I am Yvangelista XI, and I welcome you on behalf of Laterano."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "We are facing a great challenge, one that threatens not just Laterano, but all nations across Terra."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "As you know, our countries are built on the backs of nomadic cities."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "Indeed, the advent of such cities established the very concept of the modern nation state."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_356_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "In the past, a state was simply a gathering of people of similar lifestyles, huddled together for safety in the face of Catastrophe. 'National borders' were simply whatever lay within their sights."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_356_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "This all changed with the birth of nomadic cities."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "As is the human condition, conflict began to arise as these states interacted with each other."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "Perhaps even the word 'conflict' is an understatement."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_356_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "I saw the fall of Gaul with my own eyes."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_356_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "The 'Capital of the World' fell overnight. Armored battleships went silent, and the Old Vanguard of Gaul was reduced to ash."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_356_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "But it was more than Gaul that fell that night. It was the fall of civilization itself."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_356_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "All the might of the Gaulish Emperor and his legions could not save an empire that once stood proudly as the center of all lands."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_356_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "What, then, could possibly preserve our own civilization, that the people of Terra have painstakingly built, piece by piece, under the dark cloud of Catastrophe?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_356_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "Laterano gave much for the war that engulfed the entire continent. Our Messengers crossed both the wilderness and the royal courts, building Laterano's reputation."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "The Sankta heard your calls for peace."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "But our lands had seen too many shades of this so-called peace, pooling in the dark corners of castles, palaces, and tents."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "We've seen the birth of secrets, meant only to benefit a select few, that lie in wait to undermine peace and order when least expected."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "The old wars of conquest may be a distant memory, but in their place we have tacit understandings and secret dealings, that determine the fates of lives and nations from out of sight."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "Today though, Revelation has come."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "It is my hope that the process of building peace be transparent from the very start. That we will all reject secret agreements between the few."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "There are questions that anyone who does not cling to the past, anyone who is concerned about the future of this land, should be asking."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_356_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "How do we ensure the survival of civilization?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_356_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "How many people are endangered when peace is threatened?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_356_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "What does safety for one country mean for the safety of other countries?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "Civilization is key to survival. Peace is something to be shared with others, not hoarded for oneself."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "As such, I call for the establishment of an accord of mutual assurance between nations."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_356_1#10$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "We have far more common interests than many would imagine."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_356_1#10$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yvangelista XI",
        "text": "Terra must stand together, or fall together."
    },
